# This repository's own working files. They sit above the marker and survive an upgrade.
# The block below is upstream's own ignore list, vendored like every other mechanism file:
# this repository runs the system it ships (ADR-006), and that includes this part of it.

.DS_Store
*.swp
scratch/


# ─── UPSTREAM BLOCK — rnd-project-memory; replaced on upgrade, do not edit below ───

# Never commit — see ai-sandbox/SOURCES.md
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
data/

# Extracted data, in any of its usual shapes
*.csv
*.parquet
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.xlsx
*.feather
*.h5

# Backstop only. reference-only sources are NEVER placed in the repository
# (ai-sandbox/SOURCES.md); this line exists to catch the mistake, not to
# sanction the directory.
sources/reference-only/
